'''Bat Person Armor''' multiplies all {{Red|Combat Stats}} by {{Green|2x}} at night: this is increased to {{Green|3x}} during the [[Spooky Festival]]. Additionally, each piece grants a {{Green|+5%}} chance to obtain {{Item|Green Candy}} and {{Item|Purple Candy}} from mobs during the event.

Its {{AN|Bat Powers Activate!}} full set bonus upgrades the {{Item|Grappling Hook}} by removing its cooldown and increasing its velocity, alongside granting a {{Green|+5%}} chance to find {{Item|Purple Candy}}.

Players wearing '''Bat Person Armor''' are immune to fall damage.{{Confirm}} Additionally, while damaging mobs, onomatopoeic indicators can be seen around the mob, reading {{Red|Pow!}}, {{Red|Wham!}}, {{Red|Zap!}} or {{Red|Bang!}}{{Confirm}}

