== Trivia ==
*'''Bat Person Armor''' is based off of ''Batman''.
*The '''Bat Person Armor''' is one of {{Green|9}} armor pieces which have the darkest color with a hex color code of {{Color Display|#000000}}. The others are {{Item|Obsidian Chestplate}}, {{Item|Squid Boots}}, {{Item|Tarantula Armor}}, {{Item|Shadow Assassin Armor}}, {{Item|Rancher's Boots}}, {{Item|Necromancer Lord Chestplate}}, {{Item|Snorkeling Armor}} and {{Item|Wither Armor}}.
*Prior to Update 0.24.3, '''Bat Person Armor''' multiplied '''all''' stats at night or during the [[Spooky Festival]]. A common strategy would be to put a reforge granting a {{Stat|wisdom}} stat, such as {{Reforge|Dimensional}} or {{Reforge|Sunny}}, and use it to quickly level up skills.

